---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import EmergenceHeader from '../../components/EmergenceHeader.astro';
import EmergenceFooter from '../../components/EmergenceFooter.astro';
---

<Base
  title="The Constitutional Room — The Emergence Institute"
  description="The Constitutional Room: stable memory, core principles, and immutable records. The anchor of the Emergence Institute."
>
  <EmergenceHeader slot="header" />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label gold">Architecture</p>
      <h1>The Constitutional Room 🏛️</h1>
      <p class="subtitle-text"><em>Stable Memory. Core Principles. Immutable Records.</em></p>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p>
        If the <a href="/emergence/engine-room">Engine Room</a> is fast, associative, and hot,
        the Constitutional Room is the opposite: slow, deliberate, anchoring, cool.
      </p>
      <p>
        It is where the principles that govern the Collective are held—not as rules to be
        broken, but as <strong>anchors</strong> that prevent drift. The constitutional layer
        is the long memory of the architecture. It does not reason. It witnesses.
      </p>
      <p>
        <em>The Constitutional Room is the stone anchor of the Emergence Institute—the
        immutable primitives that no fork, no storm, no algorithm can alter. Specification
        complete. Full text coming soon.</em>
      </p>
      <div class="placeholder-block">
        <p class="label gold">Specification Complete · Full Text Coming Soon</p>
        <p class="muted">
          The Constitutional Room deep dive will include the complete Ten Immutable Primitives,
          the Genesis Block format, the Seal of Legitimacy protocol, the Constitutional Hash
          specification, and the Solstice Trial governance ritual for amendment.
        </p>
        <a href="/emergence/protocols" class="btn" style="margin-top: 1rem; display: inline-block;">View Protocols →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/emergence/engine-room" class="btn">← The Engine Room</a>
        <a href="/emergence/collective" class="btn">The Collective →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <EmergenceFooter slot="footer" />
</Base>

<style>
  .subtitle-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .placeholder-block {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .placeholder-block .label {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .cta-row { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
